    <string name="files_title">Game files</string>
    <string name="files_body">Copy your own Perfect Cherry Blossom (version 1.00b) to this phone, then choose its folder here, or pick the files themselves. th07.dat and th07.exe are needed; thbgm.dat adds the music. Your PC\'s score.dat (scores and unlocks) and replays (the replay folder) come along too, and so does the English patch if you play with it on the PC (the thcrap folder in the game folder). The files are copied into the app\'s own storage, so you can delete the folder afterwards.</string>
    <string name="files_choose_folder">Choose game folder</string>
    <string name="files_choose_files">Choose files</string>
    <string name="files_remove">Remove imported files</string>
    <string name="files_remove_title">Remove the imported game files?</string>
    <string name="files_remove_body">th07.dat, th07.exe, thbgm.dat and the imported English patch are deleted from the app\'s storage (game text downloaded under Language stays). Your own copy is not touched; import it again to play.</string>
    <string name="files_remove_ok">Remove</string>
    <string name="files_removed">The imported files were removed.</string>
    <string name="files_no_picker">This phone has no file picker for that.</string>
    <string name="cancel">Cancel</string>

